WebAuthnStatelessTest
├── when querying the WebAuthnValidator module types
│   ├── it should advertise MODULE_TYPE_STATELESS_VALIDATOR
│   └── it should advertise MODULE_TYPE_STATELESS_VALIDATOR_WITH_SENDER
├── when querying the WebAuthnSigner module types
│   ├── it should advertise MODULE_TYPE_STATELESS_VALIDATOR
│   └── it should advertise MODULE_TYPE_STATELESS_VALIDATOR_WITH_SENDER
├── when calling validateSignatureWithData on WebAuthnValidator before installation
│   └── it should validate against the caller-supplied public key
├── when calling validateSignatureWithData on WebAuthnSigner before installation
│   └── it should validate against the caller-supplied public key
├── when calling validateSignatureWithDataWithSender with a caller-supplied public key
│   ├── WebAuthnValidator should return true
│   └── WebAuthnSigner should return true
├── when the signed WebAuthn challenge differs from the requested hash
│   ├── WebAuthnValidator should return false
│   └── WebAuthnSigner should return false
└── when calling stateless validation with invalid configuration data
    ├── WebAuthnValidator should reject malformed data
    └── WebAuthnSigner should reject zero public-key data
